{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14231390","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14231390","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1423139001:0":{"text":"遠路はるばるご足労いただき、感謝しているよ。","source_cn":"各位代表好，感谢大家不辞奔波来到萨洛克兰。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1A0B93292ECB0ECA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1423139002:1":{"text":"ボクもドワーフの性格は分かってるつもりさ。率直なのが持ち味だよね。挨拶はこのへんにして――さっそく本題に入ろうか。","source_cn":"我多少知道一些矮人的性格，知道各位心直口快，闲话少叙，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE0885C2E4F7590C3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1423139003:1":{"text":"えっ、も、もう始めるのか！？","source_cn":"等等，谈、谈判？这就开始……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x868B4BBD6685192E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1423139004:1":{"text":"それでいい、まどろっこしいのは性に合わん。言いたいことがあるなら、ハッキリ言ってくれ。","source_cn":"小伙子这话说的不错，别拖泥带水的，有什么话都敞开说吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDED48840FCDE3F80","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1423139005:1":{"text":"皆さんの目的は、エクシルに鉱石へ魔力を注入してもらって、オルデナイトの代わりになる魔鋼を得ることだよね？","source_cn":"各位来此的目的是想让拥有魔力的艾塞勒为矿石注魔，以得到...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x41C40C4E55B56776","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","docu